{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t警方呼籲市民提供一名失蹤男子消息。71歲男子鄭健華昨晚於藍田邨最後露面後便告失蹤，其朋友向警方報案。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n他身高約1.6米，體重約50公斤，中等身材，長面型，黃皮膚及蓄短灰髮。最後露面時身穿灰白色格子短袖上衣、黑色長褲及黑色鞋。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n任何人如有該失蹤男子的消息或曾見過他，請與警方聯絡。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:03:50.456281+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:44:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:16.956601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:17.434116+00:00","content_hash":"f5b3f7f483519f5639a07b9d5bdcb25ff03dca6e7bff8b960160fec3b8056b47","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}